    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Spratt offer for sale by Online Auction Friday 09th October 2026 at 11am, this charming 2 bedroom cottage set on an attractive site in this highly sought after location within the picturesque Brickey Valley. This property offers an excellent opportunity for the purchaser to further develop and enhance the existing accommodation to their own requirements and specification, subject to planning permission. The property enjoys a tranquil setting yet is conveniently located approx. 5 km from Dungarvan town centre which offers an excellent range of amenities, including schools, creche, shops, restaurants, cafs, pubs, numerous beaches and a wide variety of sporting facilities, while the ever popular Waterford Greenway is also within easy reach. The accommodation which extends to approximately 67 sq.m comprises: living room, kitchen/diner, two bedrooms, shower room. External: Garden shed, pump house and glasshouse. REA Spratt highly recommend a viewing of this property to fully appreciate the excellent potential it has to offer. \n\nAccommodation\n\nSitting Room\n2.66m x 7.11m wall cabinets and carpeted\n\nKitchen\n4.20m x 3.39m The room features two windows overlooking the garden,Vinyl flooring, a rear door leading directly to the garden, a kitchen island, and wall-mounted cabinets.\n\nWet Room\n1.98m x 2.41m Fully tiled and fitted bathroom with a Triton T90 shower, walk-in wet room, and fitted cabinet.\n\nBedroom 1\n4.20m x 2.50m Carpet floor.\n\nBedroom 2\n3.28m x 2.50m Carpet flooring.\n\n\nOutside\n-Enclosed gardens -Garden Shed -Pump House -Glasshouse"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-Tranquil setting yet within 5km of Dungarvan Town Centre\n-Fabulous opportunity for a purchaser to further enhance to their own specification subject to necessary planning.\n-Pleasant views over the surrounding panorama\nAll light fittings, window furnishings, floor coverings, integrated appliances. \n Mains water\nSeptic tank\nOil fired central heating \n All amenities of Dungarvan \nhttps://reaspratt.bidnow.ie/lot/details/c65a6b15-4028-4e70-9bec-1b188d94eadc"
